config CRYPTO_INTEL_CSME
	bool "Intel CSME crypto engine"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_INTEL_CSME_CRYPTO_ENABLED
	help
	  The Intel CSME's crypto engine: its AES-P unit as an AES-ECB cipher
	  with raw keys or keys held in its secure key storage (SKS), and SKS
	  key derivation.
